 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes it readable by anyone with its secret public URL, no account required. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board and generates its secret public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created`.
+
+The public URL is available as `public_url` on the board, and is also directly reachable in the browser at:
+
+```
+/public/boards/:key
+/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id
+/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Its `public_url` becomes `null` again and the secret URL stops working.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
